WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.932 --> 00:00:16.341
Izzie jumping around the gym.

2
00:00:17.202 --> 00:00:19.903
She was pretending to be her pet frog, Gurpy.

3
00:00:19.924 --> 00:00:23.926
"Gurp. Gurp," she called.

4
00:00:25.027 --> 00:00:26.868
It was the second-to-last day of school.

5
00:00:27.784 --> 00:00:31.626
That meant it was also the second-to-last day of Kids Central.

6
00:00:37.368 --> 00:00:40.470
frogs and race-car drivers," Miss Shelly called.

7
00:00:44.151 --> 00:00:48.013
are ready to make today's craft—tissue-paper flowers."

8
00:00:52.775 --> 00:00:55.196
Bobby pulled a dirty tissue out of his pocket.

9
00:00:55.992 --> 00:00:57.713
"I've got a tissue right here!

10
00:00:58.693 --> 00:01:02.435
I just blew my nose on it."

11
00:01:02.455 --> 00:01:07.897
"Not that kind of tissue, Bobby," Miss Shelly said.

12
00:01:07.918 --> 00:01:11.679
"We're going to use clean wrapping tissue."

13
00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.401
She pointed to the colored tissue paper on the table.

14
00:01:15.421 --> 00:01:19.523
"Gurp. I mean, great," Izzie said.

15
00:01:20.423 --> 00:01:21.264
Nina giggled.

16
00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:29.586
"You kids are too silly today," Miss Shelly said, shaking her head.

17
00:01:29.606 --> 00:01:32.768
"Okay, let's make our flowers.

18
00:01:33.769 --> 00:01:38.211
First fold one end of your tissue paper about three centimeters.

19
00:01:38.911 --> 00:01:40.452
Then flip the tissue over.

20
00:01:41.493 --> 00:01:47.096
Next take the same edge you folded before, and fold it three centimeters the other way.

21
00:01:47.976 --> 00:01:50.398
Then flip it back over and fold again.

22
00:01:51.278 --> 00:01:54.500
Keep repeating this until you have folded the entire tissue.

23
00:01:57.172 --> 00:02:03.234
Now wrap one end of your pipe cleaner around the middle of your folded tissue," Miss Shelly said.

24
00:02:03.254 --> 00:02:10.296
"Then carefully pull apart the folds and you’ve got a pretty flower!"

25
00:02:14.077 --> 00:02:16.077
is easy," Izzie said.

26
00:02:16.937 --> 00:02:18.558
She was making a green flower.

27
00:02:18.578 --> 00:02:21.779
"I'm going to make another one!"

28
00:02:22.599 --> 00:02:24.980
Izzie reached for another piece of tissue paper.

29
00:02:28.292 --> 00:02:33.075
"Attack!" Bobby yelled as he jabbed Jason with his paper flower.

30
00:02:33.095 --> 00:02:38.918
"Hey!" Jason grabbed his flower and poked Bobby back.

31
00:02:38.938 --> 00:02:44.421
"Boys, these are flowers, not swords," Miss Shelly said sharply.

32
00:02:44.441 --> 00:02:47.943
"Miss Shelly, can you help me?

33
00:02:48.863 --> 00:02:51.745
I can't pull my tissue apart," Nina said.

34
00:02:52.885 --> 00:02:56.947
While Miss Shelly helped Nina, Izzie made three more green flowers.

35
00:02:57.964 --> 00:03:02.087
When she finished, she tied all of the ends of the pipe cleaners together.

36
00:03:02.887 --> 00:03:06.630
Then she made four more flowers and tied those ends together too.

37
00:03:11.553 --> 00:03:12.474
Izzie called out.

38
00:03:12.494 --> 00:03:15.076
"I'm a frog princess."

39
00:03:16.096 --> 00:03:18.398
She was wearing a crown of green flowers.

40
00:03:18.418 --> 00:03:23.461
"And you're my frog prince!"

41
00:03:24.622 --> 00:03:27.184
She dropped another crown over Jason's head.

42
00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:33.503
"Gurp!" Jason chased Izzie around the gym.

43
00:03:33.523 --> 00:03:37.325
"I'm not your frog prince!"

44
00:03:37.846 --> 00:03:38.386
he yelled.

45
00:03:38.406 --> 00:03:46.630
"Ooh, Izzie and Jason, sitting in a tree," Bobby began to chant.

46
00:03:47.971 --> 00:03:49.052
Miss Shelly stood up.

47
00:03:49.072 --> 00:03:51.753
"Izzie, Jason, Bobby.

48
00:03:52.594 --> 00:03:53.674
What is going on?"

49
00:03:55.055 --> 00:03:56.676
Izzie and Jason stopped running.

50
00:03:57.628 --> 00:03:58.869
Bobby stopped chanting.

51
00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.211
They stared at Miss Shelly.

52
00:04:02.371 --> 00:04:05.173
"We were going to go outside for our treat today.

53
00:04:05.974 --> 00:04:09.516
But I don't know if you three deserve it," their teacher said.

54
00:04:10.057 --> 00:04:11.077
She was serious.

55
00:04:11.097 --> 00:04:14.499
"I was thinking about Gurpy," Izzie said.

56
00:04:14.519 --> 00:04:20.223
"And I thought, what if Gurpy became a frog prince and I became a princess?

57
00:04:21.104 --> 00:04:23.205
So I made Jason be a frog prince.

58
00:04:24.126 --> 00:04:26.928
Sorry." Miss Shelly sighed.

59
00:04:27.952 --> 00:04:31.734
"Okay. Let's clean up and go outside."

60
00:04:34.636 --> 00:04:37.978
When it was time to go, Izzie tapped Miss Shelly on the arm.

61
00:04:37.998 --> 00:04:43.841
"Here." She handed Miss Shelly a bunch of tissue flowers.

62
00:04:43.861 --> 00:04:47.723
"We decided that you deserve the treat today."

63
00:04:47.743 --> 00:04:52.166
"Gurp!" said Miss Shelly.

64
00:04:52.186 --> 00:04:55.428
"I mean, thank you, Frog Princess!"
